hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1184","[AI-translation] Umm Kulsoom bint Uqba (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Wo jhootha nahi hai jo logon key darmiyaan sulah karaata hai aur bhalai badhaata hai ya bhalai kehta hai. (Bukhari: 2692)"
"1185","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Quba waley ladey yahan tak ke unhon-ne pattharon se aik doosrey ko maara. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski khabar di gai. To Aap ne farmaya: Hamaarey sath chalo, ham unkey darmiyaan sulah karaaein. (Bukhari: 2693). Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo hamaarey is muamley mein nai baat nikaaley jo us mein nahi hai to wo radd hai. (2697). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1186","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zul Qaada mein Umrah kya. To Makkah walon ne inkaar kya ke wo Aap ko Makkah mein daakhil honay dein yahan tak ke Aap ne un se sulah ki ke Aap us mein teen din thehrengey. Phir jab unhon-ne kitaab likhi to likha: Ye wo hai jis par Muhammad Rasulullah ne sulah ki. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham uska iqraar nahi kartey. Phir agar ham jaantey ke tum Rasulullah ho to ham tumhey na roktey. Lekin tum Muhammad bin Abdullah ho. Aap ne farmaya: Main Rasulullah hun aur main Muhammad bin Abdullah hun. Phir Aap ne Ali se farmaya: Rasulullah mita do. Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Main tumhey kabhi na mitaaunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kitaab li aur likha: Ye wo hai jis par Muhammad bin Abdullah ne sulah ki: Makkah mein hathiyaar daakhil na hoga magar myaan mein. Aur wo uskey rehne walon mein se kisi ko na nikaalega agar wo uskey peechey chalna chaahe. Aur apne sahaaba mein se kisi ko na rokega jo us mein rehna chaahe. Phir jab Aap us mein daakhil huey aur muddat guzar gai to wo Ali key paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Apne saathi se kaho ke ham se niklo, muddat guzar gai hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley aur Aap key peechey Hamza ki beti (aai): Ae chacha! Ae chacha! To Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) ne use liya aur uska haath pakda aur Faatima se kaha: Tumhaarey chacha ki beti lo. Us ne use utha liya. To uskey baarey mein Ali aur Zaid aur Jafar ne jhagda kya. To Ali ne kaha: Main uska zyada haqdaar hun aur wo merey chacha ki beti hai. Aur Jafar ne kaha: Merey chacha ki beti hai aur uski khaala merey nikaah mein hai. Aur Zaid ne kaha: Merey bhai ki beti hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska uski khaala key liye faisla kya aur farmaya: Khaala maan key darjey mein hai. Aur Ali se farmaya: Tum mujh se ho aur main tum se hun. Aur Jafar se farmaya: Tum meri khilqat aur merey akhlaaq se mushaabeh huey. Aur Zaid se farmaya: Tum hamaarey bhai aur hamaarey aaqa ho. (Bukhari: 2700)"
"1187","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mimbar par dekha jabke Hasan bin Ali Aap key pehlu mein they. Aur Aap logon ki taraf aik martaba mutawajjeh hotey aur unki taraf doosri martaba aur farmaatey: Beshak mera ye beta sardaar hai aur shayed Allah uskey sath Musalmaanon key do badey girohon key darmiyaan sulah karaaey. (Bukhari: 2704)"
"1188","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, wo kehtin hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne darwaazey par jhagadne walon ki aawaaz suni jabke un donon ki aawaazein buland thein. Aur un mein se aik doosrey se kami aur narmi maang raha tha kisi cheez mein jabke wo kehta tha: Allah ki qasam! Main na karunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un donon key paas nikley aur farmaya: Wo kahaan hai jo Allah par qasam khaata hai ke wo neki na karega? To us ne kaha: Main Ya Rasulullah! Aur uskey liye jo wo pasand karey. (Bukhari: 2705). Sharton ki kitaab."
